  m_Name: Item_09
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemDefinition
  itemName: "Nh\u1EADt K\xFD N\u1EA1n Nh\xE2n"
  description: "Ghi ch\xE9p h\xE9 l\u1ED9 s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt v\u1EC1 v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t."
  category: 4
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ccf7dba522e432c4ca691895cb29513f, type: 3}
  maxStack: 1
  attackBonus: 0
  defenseBonus: 0
  maxHealthBonus: 0
  healAmount: 0
  isReadable: 1
  canBeBurned: 1
  readingText: "Nh\u1EADt k\xFD c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng trong
    c\u0103n nh\xE0 hoang.\n\n\u201C\u0110\xEAm n\xE0o ta c\u0169ng nghe ti\u1EBFng
    b\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xE2n tr\xEAn g\xE1c. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi trong g\u01B0\u01A1ng
    kh\xF4ng c\xF2n c\u1EED \u0111\u1ED9ng gi\u1ED1ng ta n\u1EEFa. \xD4ng l\xE3o
    g\u1ECDi n\xF3 l\xE0 V\xF4 Di\u1EC7n \u2014 m\u1ED9t th\u1EE9 chi\u1EBFm l\u1EA5y
    th\xE2n x\xE1c khi ch\u1EE7 nh\xE2n ch\xECm v\xE0o gi\u1EA5c ng\u1EE7.\u201D\n\n\u201CN\u1EBFu
    Kh\u1EA3i t\xECm th\u1EA5y cu\u1ED1n s\u1ED5 n\xE0y, \u0111\u1EEBng tin nh\u1EEFng
    k\xFD \u1EE9c c\xF2n nguy\xEAn v\u1EB9n. M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n t\u1EC9nh d\u1EADy,
    m\xE1u tr\xEAn tay l\u1EA1i nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n.\u201D\n\nM\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng
    \u0111\u1ED9ng r\xEDt l\xEAn sau l\u01B0ng. B\u1EA7y nh\u1EC7n trong b\xF3ng
    t\u1ED1i b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u b\xF2 ra."
  rarity: "Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5"
  dropSource: Connected Zone 1-2 / story through Session 5. Edit icon and stats in
    the Inspector.
